title: Where a running C program keeps things
layer stack: Stack @ high addresses
in stack: frame = `main`'s frame; local = local variables of the function now running
layer heap: Heap
in heap: blk = `malloc` block; free = free space
layer data: Data\nsegment
in data: glob = globals
layer text: Text @ low addresses
in text: code = machine code
local ..> blk: points into
hot: local
shade: free
